  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy for SDUB on Housing Finance and Maraza development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support SDUBeira in the realization of a first phase construction of five to ten houses/apartments in the mini-pilot area by developing attractive and solid financial structures for the affordable housing chain in Beira.The consultant is expected to work closely together with the SDUBeira management. In the initial phase Casa Real, Empowa, the International Labour Organization (ILO) and GAPI Bank are the logical cooperation partners. If other opportunities for cooperation with financiers and developers occur, they will be explored and further developed. The expert will explore and advice on potential parallel tracks for the first phase and next phases and to advice on a market strategy to further promote the development of Maraza.</narrative>
  </description>
